  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Foldable Key Phone Stand. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the Foldable Key Phone Stand on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<p> </p>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Foldable Key Phone Stand</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>Foldable Key Phone Stand </strong>on <strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/951268#profileId-919270\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">MakerWorld.</a></span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/72dd8ec1a0a94446978e33b8eae8c759/cf05b551b3394b13a55fb7591c0f6474.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZ